SRC_DNODE_CHILD_59: DContainer = DContainer(module='software', namespace='urn:fleetmgr:software', prefix='sw-cfs', name='plan', config=False, description="The materialized plan: every window the campaign is placed\ninto, the devices assigned to each, and their times: real for\nreleased devices, estimated for the rest. A member that is done\nwithout a release, because its status was final while it\nwaited, is in no window. The companion actor computes it from\nthe campaign; the transform actuates the same computation, so\nwhat runs is what is shown. Estimates, not guarantees. In plan,\nit is the plan of the run as it would go on now; before the\nfirst run, of a run that starts now.\nHeld members, such as the members that have not answered the\ncampaign's target, upgrade-needed or a final status, get an\nalarm, and device-status says why. A held member shows in the\nwindow promised to it, or else in the first window of its\nschedule that has not closed. A member that keeps a promise\nbut that the plan starts in no window shows in the window\npromised to it too, and the alarm that it will miss that\nwindow names it. With allow-staging, each member's\nprepare-start says when it prepares. After a restart of\nfleetmgr, a member that the campaign has freed is in no\nwindow.", presence=False, adata_name='plan', children=[SRC_DNODE_CHILD_60, SRC_DNODE_CHILD_61, SRC_DNODE_CHILD_62, SRC_DNODE_CHILD_63, SRC_DNODE_CHILD_64, SRC_DNODE_CHILD_65, SRC_DNODE_CHILD_66, SRC_DNODE_CHILD_67, SRC_DNODE_CHILD_68])

